## Design Section 2: CO (Decision Maker) Screen

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ HEADER: Title ──── [████ Stress Bar ████] ──── RT / Turn   │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ TURN 3 — Phishing Attack Detected                          │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Systems: [NAV ●] [COMMS ●] [RADAR ●]   Warfare: [ASW ●]…  │
├───────────────────┬───────────────────┬─────────────────────┤
│    OPS (mirror)   │    NAV (mirror)   │    PWO (mirror)     │
│  ┌─────────────┐  │  ┌─────────────┐  │  ┌─────────────┐   │
│  │ INTEL       │  │  │ INTEL       │  │  │ INTEL       │   │  ← same intel
│  ├─────────────┤  │  ├─────────────┤  │  ├─────────────┤   │    crew sees
│  │ DECISION    │  │  │ DECISION    │  │  │ DECISION    │   │
│  │ OPTIONS     │  │  │ OPTIONS     │  │  │ OPTIONS     │   │  ← read-only
│  │ ☑ picked ←  │  │  │ pending…    │  │  │ ☑ picked ←  │   │    highlighted
│  └─────────────┘  │  └─────────────┘  │  └─────────────┘   │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ CO DECISION BAR                                             │
│ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐        │
│ │ Option A │ │ Option B │ │ Option C │ │ Option D │        │
│ │          │ │ ★OPS,PWO │ │          │ │          │ [CONFIRM]
│ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ └──────────┘        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Key rules:**
- Top 3 columns = **full mirror** of what each crew role sees (intel + decision options), but **read-only** — no submit buttons
- When an advisor submits a recommendation, their pick gets highlighted in their column (green border, checkmark)
- "pending..." shown for advisors who haven't submitted yet
- **CO Decision Bar** = full-width strip at bottom, replaces the footer area
  - Shows all decision options as horizontal cards
  - Options recommended by advisors get a badge: "★ OPS, PWO" (listing which roles recommended it)
  - CO picks option(s), then clicks Confirm
  - When no active decision: bar shows "Waiting for next decision..." in muted state
- CO's own intel (if any from `role_descriptions[co_role_id]`) shows as a subtle callout above the decision bar

## Design Section 3: Interaction States

### Card states across both screens

| State | Intel Zone | Decision Zone |
|-------|-----------|---------------|
| **No event, no decision** | "Waiting for next turn..." (muted) | "No active decision" (muted) |
| **Event only (intel)** | Role-specific description | "No active decision" (muted) |
| **Event + active decision** | Role-specific description | Options + submit button |
| **Decision submitted (done)** | Role-specific description | "Selected: [option]" + muted opacity |

**Critical rule:** Both zones maintain their fixed height in ALL states. Empty/waiting states use centered muted text. No collapsing, no resizing.

### Focus mode (crew screen)

| Element | Expanded column (2fr) | Shrunk columns (0.5fr) |
|---------|----------------------|----------------------|
| Role header | Full: ID + label + badge | Compact: ID + badge only |
| Intel zone | Full text, scrollable | Single line, truncated with ellipsis |
| Decision zone | Full options + submit | Status only: "DECISION" badge or "DONE ✓" |

- Transition: `grid-template-columns` with `200ms ease`
- Trigger: click on column header to expand, click again to collapse
- Keyboard: left/right arrows to cycle focus, Esc to reset to equal thirds

### CO mirror columns interaction

- Columns are **read-only** — no radio buttons, no submit
- Options are listed as plain text, not interactive labels
- When advisor submits: their picked option gets `role-card__option--selected` styling + a checkmark icon
- Unpicked options stay muted
- "pending..." shows in the decision zone header until the advisor submits

## Design Section 4: Responsive Scaling

### Laptop (1280–1440px width)
- 3 equal columns, comfortable spacing
- Decision bar options wrap if >4 options

### Large monitor (1920px+)
- Columns get more breathing room, max-width cap at ~500px per column
- Content stays centered with margin auto on the grid container
- Decision bar options spread out, no wrapping

### Narrow laptop (1024px)
- Columns compress but stay 3-wide
- Font sizes step down one tier
- System/warfare chips wrap to second row if needed

### Below 1024px (emergency fallback)
- Switch to tabbed view (one role at a time + tab strip)
- Not the primary target, just prevents breaking

## Design Section 5: CSS Architecture

```css
/* Crew screen: 3 equal columns */
.board-columns {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: var(--spacing-md);
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 0; /* allow shrinking within grid row */
}

/* Focus mode */
.board-columns[data-focus="0"] { grid-template-columns: 2fr 0.5fr 0.5fr; }
.board-columns[data-focus="1"] { grid-template-columns: 0.5fr 2fr 0.5fr; }
.board-columns[data-focus="2"] { grid-template-columns: 0.5fr 0.5fr 2fr; }

/* Each column */
.board-column {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-rows: auto 2fr 3fr; /* header | intel 40% | decision 60% */
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: 2px;
  background: var(--color-card);
  transition: grid-template-columns 200ms ease;
}

/* Fixed zones — scroll internally */
.board-column__intel,
.board-column__decision {
  overflow-y: auto;
  padding: var(--spacing-md);
}

/* CO decision bar */
.co-decision-bar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--spacing-md);
  padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);
  border-top: 2px solid var(--color-success);
  background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--color-success) 5%, var(--color-card));
}

.co-decision-bar__option {
  flex: 1 1 0;
  /* ... same as role-card__option but horizontal */
}

.co-decision-bar__option[data-recommended] {
  border-color: var(--color-primary);
  box-shadow: var(--glow-sm);
}
```

### Component changes needed:
- **`player-view.ts`** — detect `isDecisionMaker` vs `isAllAdvisors` and render different layouts
- **`board-column.component.ts`** (new) — wraps a role card's content in the fixed-zone column layout, handles focus click
- **`co-decision-bar.component.ts`** (new) — horizontal option picker with recommendation badges
- **`role-card.component.ts`** — refactor to accept a `readonly` input for CO mirror mode (hides submit button, shows advisor pick highlight)
- **CSS** — new `.board-columns` grid replaces `.board-grid` flexbox

---

That's the full design. Let me write it to the plans directory.

