# Two-Player Layout Redesign — Implementation Plan

> **For Claude:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task.

**Goal:** Replace the flex-wrap role card layout with a fixed-zone 3-column CSS grid for the crew (all_advisors) and CO (decision_maker) player views in 2-player mode.

**Architecture:** The player-view template branches on player role: `all_advisors` renders a 3-column grid with fixed intel/decision zones per column; `decision_maker` renders the same 3-column grid (read-only mirrors) plus a full-width CO decision bar at the bottom. A new `BoardColumnComponent` wraps each role's intel and decision content into fixed vertical zones. The existing `RoleCardComponent` gains a `readonly` mode for CO mirrors. A new `CoDecisionBarComponent` handles the CO's option picker with recommendation badges.

**Tech Stack:** Angular 21 (standalone, signals, OnPush), CSS @layer in `components-player-view.css`, Vitest for unit tests.

**Design doc:** `docs/plans/2026-03-22-two-player-layout-design.md`

**Worktree:** `.worktrees/two-player-layout` on branch `feature/two-player-layout`

**Test command:** `cd apps/tfc/frontend && npx ng test --watch=false`

---

### Task 1: CSS — Replace board-grid flexbox with board-columns CSS grid

**Files:**
- Modify: `apps/tfc/frontend/src/app/shared/components-player-view.css`

**Step 1: Add new `.board-columns` grid CSS**

Add after the existing `.board-grid` block (line ~312) in `components-player-view.css`:

```css
  /* ── Board Columns (3-column fixed layout) ─────────── */

  .board-columns {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    transition: grid-template-columns 200ms ease;
  }

  /* Focus mode — expand one column, shrink others */
  .board-columns[data-focus="0"] { grid-template-columns: 2fr 0.5fr 0.5fr; }
  .board-columns[data-focus="1"] { grid-template-columns: 0.5fr 2fr 0.5fr; }
  .board-columns[data-focus="2"] { grid-template-columns: 0.5fr 0.5fr 2fr; }

  /* ── Board Column (single role column) ──────────────── */

  .board-column {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: auto 2fr 3fr;
    min-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--color-card);
  }

  .board-column__header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-md);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .board-column__header:hover {
    background: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .board-column__role-id {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .board-column__role-label {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-muted-foreground);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .board-column__intel {
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: var(--spacing-md);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .board-column__decision {
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  /* Empty state text for zones */
  .board-column__empty {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 100%;
    color: var(--color-muted-foreground);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
