You are implementing Task 3: RoleCardComponent — add readonly mirror mode

## Task Description

Add a `readonly` input to the existing RoleCardComponent so the CO player can see a read-only mirror of what each crew role sees (options displayed but not interactive, advisor's pick highlighted).

**Files to modify:**
- `apps/tfc/frontend/src/app/features/player/role-card.component.ts`
- `apps/tfc/frontend/src/app/features/player/role-card.component.spec.ts`

## What to Change in the Component

1. Add a new input: `readonly readonly = input(false);`

2. In the template, change the active decision form condition from:
   ```
   @if (card().decision && card().status === "active") {
   ```
   To:
   ```
   @if (card().decision && card().status === "active" && !readonly()) {
   ```

3. Add a NEW block right after the interactive decision form block for the readonly mirror:
   ```html
   @if (card().decision && card().status === "active" && readonly()) {
     <div class="role-card__decision">
       @for (option of filteredOptions(); track option.id) {
         <div
           class="role-card__option"
           [class.role-card__option--selected]="isRecommended(option.id)"
         >
           <span>{{ option.label }}</span>
           @if (isRecommended(option.id)) {
             <span class="role-card__rec-check">✓</span>
           }
         </div>
       }
       @if (pendingLabel()) {
         <div class="role-card__done" style="font-style: italic;">
           {{ pendingLabel() }}
         </div>
       }
     </div>
   }
   ```

4. Add the `isRecommended` method:
   ```typescript
   protected isRecommended(optionId: string): boolean {
     const recs = this.card().decision?.recommendations ?? {};
     return Object.values(recs).includes(optionId);
   }
   ```

5. Add a `pendingLabel` computed that shows "pending..." when no recommendation has been submitted for this role:
   ```typescript
   readonly pendingLabel = computed(() => {
     if (!this.readonly()) return null;
     const recs = this.card().decision?.recommendations ?? {};
     const roleId = this.card().roleId;
     const hasRec = Object.keys(recs).some((key) => extractRecRoleId(key) === roleId);
     return hasRec ? null : "pending...";
   });
   ```

## Tests to Add

Update the TestHost to include the `readonly` signal:

```typescript
@Component({
  imports: [RoleCardComponent],
  template: `
    <tfc-role-card
      [card]="card()"
      [systems]="systems()"
      [readonly]="readonly()"
      (submitted)="onSubmit($event)"
    />
  `,
})
class TestHost {
  readonly card = signal(makeCard());
  readonly systems = signal<SystemSnapshot[]>([]);
  readonly readonly = signal(false);
  lastSubmission: RoleCardSubmission | null = null;
  onSubmit(s: RoleCardSubmission): void {
    this.lastSubmission = s;
  }
}
